  unitName: Lovely Comet Janice
  unitId: 51086
  unitNumber: 1515
  description: A warrior woman that won incredible popularity in the Grand Gaia Arena
    in the land of Atharva, long before the war between humanity and the gods. Though
    her early life is completely shrouded in mystery, historians do know that she
    went on to join the Zektasa team. She generated countless passionate fans with
    her incomparable strength and showmanship. Silk screen prints of her image sold
    at incredible rates at the time, and are still occasionally excavated from the
    former site of the Arena.
  summonDesc: So you're another of my fans?<br>Aww, don't blush.<br>I'll fight for
    you! Hehe.
  fusionDesc: Huh, a job?! You don't have to be so polite about it. But since you
    asked nicely, of course I'll do it!
